</activity>

<activity>
 <!--Question 33-->
<statement>
<p>Use the Two Proportions applet, again entering the appropriate table of data first, to conduct a simulation analysis. Report the approximate p-value and summarize your conclusion in terms of strength of evidence that yawning is contagious. Also indicate whether you would find strong evidence against the null hypothesis at the 0.05 significance level.</p>
